& [P5RuntimeSupportAndRequirementDeltaLedger] is the support and requirement delta ledger for P5 runtime implementation activation
  + [support_delta] is P5 runtime implementation has accepted pure runtime model helpers for P5 fixture classification, deterministic transition evidence, checkpoint nonauthority, SOP interrupt handoff, stale checkpoint rebake, and no-authority notices
  + [support_delta] is P5 runtime implementation has accepted generated trace path policy and fixture runner contract
  + [support_delta] is P5 runtime implementation has accepted tests and generated trace nonpromotion/no-live-effect proof
  + [support_delta] is P5 runtime dependency, adapter, dispatch, operations, and live-control work remains deferred
  + [requirement_delta] is downstream P6, P7, and P9 readiness may consume P5 runtime implementation only as bounded proof evidence
  + [requirement_delta] is downstream work must not treat P5 runtime evidence as dependency, adapter, dispatch, operations-control, or live-control authority
  + [requirement_delta] is future live runtime integration requires a separate source-preserved authority path

